<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - HBO &amp; Co raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - HBO &amp; Co raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Interstate/Johnson Lane said it upgraded HBO &amp; Co to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- said the recent pullback in the stock price represents a good opportunity to buy.</p>
<p>-- expects strong growth in 1997, with earnings per share increasing 34 percent to $1.60 per share. Sees earnings of $2.15 a share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- set an 18-24-month price target of $80 a share.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
